  "decodedPhysicalFindings": [
    "Viewed both full decoded heights/XYZ, full fixed opposed neutral and textured lights, and the literal central-petal panel. Glass remains flat; frame and came remain shallowly above it. Painted scene details do not become embossed terrain.",
    "The corrected central opening preserves surrounding came in both tiers. Restored came points remain above pane values after lossy encoding; small mixed neighborhoods are reported honestly. No persistent deep frame trench, wrong pigment relief or introduced raised painted rim is apparent.",
    "Q92 height/XYZ quantization produces finite precision, but it does not reverse the intended broad pane/frame hierarchy in the actual reviewed maps."
  ],
